<title>FINLAND: FORECAST - PSP SEES FINNISH 1997 GROWTH AT 3.5 PCT.</title>
<headline>FORECAST - PSP SEES FINNISH 1997 GROWTH AT 3.5 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-01-31</dateline>
<text>
<p>Postipankki Oy has raised its forecast for Finnish 1997 economic growth to 3.5 percent from 3.2 percent in November, the bank said in a report received on Friday.  </p>
<p>Postipankki lowered its forecast for the rise in Finnish</p>
<p>consumer prices this year to 1.3 percent. Its November forecast</p>
<p>was 1.6 percent.</p>
<p>The state-controlled bank's economists also cut their</p>
<p>earlier 15.4 percent 1997 unemployment rate forecast to 15.0</p>
<p>percent.</p>
<p>Key figures in Postipankki's January forecast (pct):</p>
<p>1997</p>
<p> GDP			 +3.5</p>
<p> Exports		   +4.8</p>
<p> Imports		   +2.8</p>
<p> Private consumption   +3.1</p>
<p> Investment		+3.5</p>
<p> C/A (bln mk)	     +27</p>
<p> CPI			 +1.3</p>
<p> Jobless rate	    15.0</p>
<p>--Helsinki Newsroom  +358 - 9 - 680 50 245</p>
